{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ある待ち時間／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/19/7416372/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は乃木どこ収録でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/19/7416372/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6th制作が本格的に入って、\n来週もかなり忙しいです。\n体力と健康面をちゃんとしなきゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........\nもう公式で発表されましたが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと私、\n『16人のプリンシパルdeux』\n大阪公演初日\n学業のため欠席します..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うわーーーーーー\nしょーーーーーーーーーーっく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月の名古屋個握といい、\nみなさんに申し訳ない。\n公演は2日目から出演しますので\n待っててください><\n........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のBBJ見ましたかー！\n録画したのを見たら\n出ないと思ってたのに\n一瞬出てちょっとびっくりした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/19/7416372/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/19/7416372/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとう♪\nらりんにぎゅってしてもらうと\nなんだか安心するんです。\nどこまでも全力で真っ直ぐで\n大き過ぎる声も滝汗まで素敵です。\nらりんは乃木坂の太陽よ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほめすぎた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/19/7416372/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日も頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/19/7416372/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}